    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-human=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>\"The first time anyone drew an antelope on a wall, they were already two thoughts ahead of the antelope.\"</em></p>\n<p><strong>Pattern-Mind (1/Soma Break).</strong> Spend 1 minute observing a situation — a battle line, a marketplace, a council, a storm system, a faction's public posture — then ask the GM one of: <em>\"What is the actual goal here?\" · \"What is being deliberately hidden?\" · \"Who is about to break first?\"</em> The GM gives at least one true answer. They may colour it; they may not lie about it.</p>\n<div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"humCroMagnonPatternMind\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Pattern-Mind</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Action (1-min observation) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Observe situation 1 min → ask GM one of three deep questions; at least one truth.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
